  'named after a revolutionary war scout; during the fall season there is a Moses Reaper variation coated in ash with an orange hued annatto paste interior; Jasper Hill converts their dairy byproducts (whey) into food for heritage breed pigs as well as utilizing green energy', array['figs', 'cured meats', 'crisp apples', 'crisp white wine or dry bubbly'],
