  '10 days to 6 weeks', array['Lactic', 'Smokey', 'Spicy', 'Tangy'],
  'a smokey paprika dusted, bloomy rind, goat cheese pyramid named for Judy Schaad’s (Capriole’s founder) granddaughter Piper.', array['cured meats like rust belt saucisson from Smoking Goose', 'peppadews', 'pickled grapes'],
