(
  'sofia', 'Sofia', 'Capriole Creamery',
  'Not provided by creamery', 'Southern Indiana', 'USA',
  'Pasteurized Goat', 'Animal', 'Mold-ripened/Soft-ripened/Bloomy-rind',
  'Released as soon as a rind forms (fewer than two weeks)', array['Clean', 'tangy', 'lemon', 'pepper', 'bright'],
  'Capriole’s most popular goat’s milk cheese, it won a Good Food Award in 2020. Inspired by the creamery’s love affair with the Loire in France. This cheese gets dribbly when it ripens, and the paste is spreadable.', array['Vouvray', 'cool climate Sauvignon Blanc', 'fresh fruit', 'dried apricots', 'crusty bread'],
