  'Interlaken', 'NY', 'USA',
  'Pasteurized Goat', 'Animal', 'goat blue',
  '1 month minimum', array['a goat milk blue with rich', 'earthy', 'and mushroom flavors.'],
  'a goat milk blue named after Cayuga Lake (the longest of the Finger Lakes). Made on a family farm, it is also one of the longest operating goat dairies in the United States.', array['Beef salami and mushroom burgers.'],
