  'Point Reyes', 'CA', 'USA',
  'Pasteurized Cow', 'Vegetarian', 'Flavored blue',
  '90 days minimum', array['earthy', 'slightly sweet', 'fennel', 'and mild blue flavor.'],
  'Bay Blue infused with fennel seeds. Placed second at the 2025 US Champion Cheese Contest. Point Reyes is a woman-owned creamery that started making cheese in August of 2000 as third generation farmers in Point Reyes, CA.', array['Gin and Tonic', 'salads', 'or snack on with salami.'],
