  'Lee', 'MA', 'USA',
  'Pasteurized Jersey cow', 'Traditional', 'Blue veined',
  '2-3 months', array['Heavy Cream', 'Rich', 'Earthy', 'Mushrooms'],
  'a natural rind blue cheese from farmstead High Lawn Creamery! Small-ish wheel with a spreadable and crumbly texture all at once. High Lawn raises all Jersey cows and has been milking for over 100 Years', array['citrusy whiskey cocktails', 'dessert wines', 'rye bread', 'cruciferous vegetables'],
