(
  'red-rock', 'Red Rock', 'Roelli Cheese Haus',
  'Shullsburg', 'Wisconsin', 'USA',
  'Pasteurized Cow', 'Animal', 'Cheddar blue',
  '60 days minimum', array['a natural rinded cheddar with blue veins with a mild earthy', 'tangy', 'and peppery notes.'],
  'an original from Master Cheesemaker Chris Roelli (a fourth generation cheesemaker) that gets its name from the local stone surrounding the aging room. Chris Roelli is a certified master of cheddar, blue, and alpine styles. 2013 Best in Class at US Champion Cheese Contest.', array['dried fruits and Pinot Noir or sparkling wine.'],
